  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man, nen, dhanu pa Mungu ai kud i Yuda ku lembe pa Yehova i Beth-el: e Yeroboam ucungo ng’et pemblam kara ewang’ udok ma ng’wice ng’ar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.23.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ub 23:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.23.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ekok kum pemblamne ku lembe pa Yehova, ewacu de kumae, E pemblam, pemblam, Yehova wacu kumae: Nen, jubinyolo nyathin ma nico i ot pa Daudi, ma nyinge Yosia; man ebilamu julam m’i ka ma malu i wii, man gibiwang’u cogo dhanu i wii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man emio giranyutha ceng’ nica, ewacu kumae, Maeni giranyutha ma Yehova yero: Nen, pemblam bing’eny, man vuru ma ni wie jubioyo woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, kinde m’ubimo winjo lembawaca pa dhanu pa Mungu, m’ekok ku kum pemblam m’i Beth-el, nia Yeroboam urieyo cinge ku ba pemblam, ewacu kumae, Wumake. Man cinge, m’erieyo i kume, utal, ketho nia ecopo dole kendo ngo i bang’e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pemblam bende ung’eny, man vuru oi woko ku wi pemblamne, calku lembanyutha ma dhanu pa Mungu mio ku lembe pa Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ubimo loko lembe ewacu de ni dhanu pa Mungu kumae, Kawono kwai bero pa Yehova Mungu peri, man irwo pira, kara cinga dwog ira kendo kakare. E dhanu pa Mungu kwayu Yehova, man cing ubimo dwogo kendo ire kakare, man edoko calu ma naka ebedo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ubimo wacu ni dhanu pa Mungu kumae, Waci wakudi pacu, man idwok cwinyi, man abimio iri sukulia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dhanu pa Mungu wacu ni ubimo kumae, kadok imio ira ng’et ot peri ngi, wabimondo wakudi ngo, kadi camu kwen kadi madhu pi de abitimo ngo kakeni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kum jung’olo kumeni ira ku lembe pa Yehova, juwacu kumae, Ibicamu kwen moko ngo, kadi madhu pi de, kadok dok kud i yo m’ibino i ie de. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno ecidho ku yor i yo mange, man edwogo ngo kud i yo m’ebino ko Beth-el.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwang’u jabila m’uti bedo i Beth-el; man ng’atu acel ma kind wote bino yero ire tic ceke ma dhanu pa Mungu timo ceng’ maeca i Beth-el: lembe m’eyero ni ubimo, giyero maeno bende ni weggi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man weggi wacu igi kumae, Ecidho yo kani? Nwang’u wote gineno yo ma dhanu pa Mungu cidho i ie, m’uai i Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ni wote kumae, Wuketh jambwoth ira wi kana. Kum kumeno giketho jambwoth ire wi kanane; man ewotho kud i wie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E elubo tok dhanu pa Mungu, man enwang’e m’ebedo the bongu m’ujany; e ewacu ire kumae, In i dhanu pa Mungu m’uai kud i Yuda? Man ewacu kumae, An a en. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elund ewacu ire kumae, Waci pacu wakudi, man wacam kwen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu kumae, Wacopo dok wakudi ngo, kadi mondo kudi de; kadok camu kwen kadi madhu pi de wabicamu wabimadhu kudi ngo i ka maeni: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kum juwacu ira ku lembe pa Yehova kumae, Kud icam kwen kadi madhu pi de kuca, kadi kud idok kendo ku yor i yo m’ibino i ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ire kumae, An de an a jabila calu in; man malaika yero ira ku lembe pa Yehova, ewacu kumae, Dwog kude i ot peri, kara ecam kwen man emadh pi. Ento ecwayu ndra ire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno gidok gikude, man ecamu kwen i ot pare, emadhu pi de.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, ka gibedo dhu mesa, nia lembe pa Yehova bino ba jabila ma gidwogo gikude; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man ekok ni dhanu pa Mungu m’uai i Yuda, ewacu kumae, Yehova wacu kumae, Kum iworo lembe ma dhu Yehova ngo, man iworo lembang’ola ma Yehova Mungu peri ng’olo iri ngo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento idwogo, man icamu kwen imadhu pi de i ka m’ewacu iri pire kumae, Kud icam kwen, man kud imadh pi moko; kumi bidok ba odliel pa kwaru ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, yo ng’ei kwen m’ecamu, man yo ng’ei madhu m’emadhu, nia eketho jambwoth ire wi kana, ni jabila m’edwoke cen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kinde m’ecidho, umvor urombo kude i yo, e enege: man jubolo avuje i yo, e kana cungo i ng’ete; umvor bende cungo i ng’et avuje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man, nen, dhanu kadhu, man gineno avu ma jubayu i yo, man umvor m’ucungo i ng’et avune; e gibino giyero maeni i adhura ka ma jabila m’uti ni ie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kinde ma jabila m’udwoke cen kud i yo winjo pire, ewacu kumae, En e dhanu pa Mungu, m’uworo lembe ma dhu Yehova ngo: ka kumeno Yehova mie ni umvor, m’uyece, m’unege de, calu lembe pa Yehova, m’eyero pire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E eyero ni wote, ewacu kumae, Wuketh jambwoth ira wi kana. Man giketho jambwoth i wie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ecidho enwang’u avuje ma jubayu i yo, ku kana man umvor m’ucungo ng’et avune: umvor ucamu avune ngo, kadok kana de eyeco ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E jabila ting’o avu dhanu pa Mungu, man ekethe wi kana, e edwoke cen; man etundo bang’ adhura pa jabila m’uti, kara eywak, man eyike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man eketho avuje i liel pare gire; e giywak i wie, giwacu kumae, Akayo, umira yo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, yo ng’ei yik m’eyike, nia eyero ni wote, ewacu kumae, Kinde m’atho, wulund wuyika i odliel ma juyiko ie dhanu pa Mungu; wuketh cogona i ng’et cogone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum lembawaca m’ekok ko ku lembe pa Yehova kum pemblam m’i Beth-el, man kum udi ceke mi ka ma malu ma gini i adhura mi Samaria, bitimbre kakare andha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
